  unitName: Andaria
  unitId: 830134
  unitNumber: 8059
  description: Andaria was created by the old gods, birthed from the elements of
    earth and air. She is a demi-god with exceptional combat intelligence and a master
    of the bow. She could draw and shoot faster than any common man and demi-gods
    with a gun. Before the war, she specialized in researching the past and putting
    a history on the demi-god civilization origins. When the war broke out, she vowed
    to protect the holy lands where the first demi-gods were created.
  summonDesc: Let us stop the enemy!
  fusionDesc: My weapon efficiency is key.
